        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "[codex] Add Kimi monthly subscription usage",
        "body": "## Summary\n- Fetch Kimi subscription stats from the web membership endpoint when using the browser/cookie source.\n- Surface `subscriptionBalance.amountUsedRatio` as a Monthly usage window.\n- Keep existing Weekly and Rate Limit windows from the existing Kimi usage endpoint.\n\n## Why\nKimi exposes monthly subscription usage separately from the existing coding usage response. Without this additional endpoint, CodexBar can show the weekly and rate-limit windows but not the monthly subscription balance.\n\n## Validation\n- `swift build --target CodexBarCore`\n- `make format`\n- `git diff --check`\n\nNote: full app/test validation could not be completed in this local Command Line Tools-only environment because SwiftUI/SwiftLint tooling requires the full Xcode toolchain.\n\n\n\n## Live Proof\n- Redacted live CodexBar screenshot showing Kimi Weekly, Rate Limit, and Monthly usage windows rendered from the Kimi provider.\n\n![Kimi Monthly proof](https://github.com/zhiyue/CodexBar/releases/download/pr-1839-proof/codex-clipboard-IOIxYL.png)\n",
